<title>USA: Hartford Cty Met Dist., Conn., won by Advest.</title>
<headline>Hartford Cty Met Dist., Conn., won by Advest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advest, Inc., said it won $4.900 million of Hartford Cty Metropolitan District, Conn., general obligation bonds, Issue, 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.7984 percent.</p>
</text>
